### 1. Rejestracja Anny (od razu dostaje "Mój portfel")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Anna", "email": "anna21@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

> {% client.global.set("annaToken", response.body.token); %}

### 1b. Logowanie Anny (zamiast 1, gdy konto już istnieje)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna21@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

> {% client.global.set("annaToken", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Rejestracja Bartka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Bartek", "email": "bartek@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

> {% client.global.set("bartekToken", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("bartekId", response.body.user.id); %}

### 2b. Logowanie Bartka (zamiast 2, gdy konto już istnieje)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bartek@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

> {% client.global.set("bartekToken", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("bartekId", response.body.user.id); %}

### 3. Nowy portfel Anny do testów
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test zaproszeń" }

> {% client.global.set("walletId", response.body.id); %}

### 4. Anna zaprasza Bartka jako Członka, oczekiwane 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bartek@test.pl", "role": "MEMBER" }

### 5. To samo drugi raz, oczekiwane 409 ALREADY_INVITED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bartek@test.pl", "role": "MEMBER" }

### 6. Anna zaprasza samą siebie, oczekiwane 400 SELF
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna21@test.pl", "role": "MEMBER" }

### 7. E-mail bez konta, oczekiwane 404 NO_ACCOUNT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nikt@test.pl", "role": "MEMBER" }

### 8. Zaproszenia Bartka (ownerName: "Anna")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

> {% client.global.set("invitationId", response.body[0].id); %}

### 9. Bartek przyjmuje, oczekiwane 204
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invitations/{{invitationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

### 10. Drugi raz, oczekiwane 409 INVITATION_ALREADY_ANSWERED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invitations/{{invitationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

### 11. Portfel z perspektywy Bartka: role MEMBER, 2 osoby w members, invitations []
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

### 12. Bartek (Członek) próbuje kogoś zaprosić, oczekiwane 403 NOT_OWNER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna@test.pl", "role": "GUEST" }

### 13. Anna zmienia Bartkowi rolę na Gościa, oczekiwane 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/members/{{bartekId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "GUEST" }

### 14. Próba nadania roli OWNER, oczekiwane 400 INVALID_ROLE
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/members/{{bartekId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "OWNER" }

### 15. Anna próbuje opuścić własny portfel, oczekiwane 400 OWNER_CANNOT_LEAVE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}

### 16. Bartek opuszcza portfel, oczekiwane 204
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

### 17. Bartek pyta o portfel po wyjściu, oczekiwane 404 WALLET_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

### 18. Anna zaprasza Bartka znowu (po wyjściu wolno), oczekiwane 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bartek@test.pl", "role": "GUEST" }

### 19. Zaproszenia Bartka
GET http://localhost:8080/api/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

> {% client.global.set("invitationId", response.body[0].id); %}

### 20. Bartek odrzuca, oczekiwane 204
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invitations/{{invitationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{bartekToken}}

### 21. Anna usuwa portfel (kaskada usuwa członkostwa i zaproszenia), oczekiwane 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}